=== C04 健康与就绪（依赖中断）| 2026-11-08 11:25:48 ===
被测软件 SHA: d063588c3be59b1e9f013ff27e2a541cc03fed62 (main)
方法：独立审计实例 t3-audit-api@8011（临时 pg/redis 容器），停对应容器制造中断，日常站点与日常库不受影响

--- 基线 ---
/health :: HTTP 200 :: {"code":0,"message":"ok","data":{"status":"ok","dependencies":{"database":"ok","redis":"ok"}}}
/ready  :: HTTP 200 :: {"code":0,"message":"ok","data":{"status":"ok","dependencies":{"database":"ok","redis":"ok"}}}

--- 场景1：停止 Redis ---
/health :: HTTP 200 :: {"code":0,"message":"ok","data":{"status":"degraded","dependencies":{"database":"ok","redis":"unavailable"}}}
/ready  :: HTTP 503 :: 
--- 恢复 Redis ---
/health :: HTTP 200 :: {"code":0,"message":"ok","data":{"status":"ok","dependencies":{"database":"ok","redis":"ok"}}}

--- 场景2：停止数据库 ---
/health :: HTTP 200 :: {"code":0,"message":"ok","data":{"status":"degraded","dependencies":{"database":"unavailable","redis":"ok"}}}
/ready  :: HTTP 503 :: 

--- 场景2 补充：/ready 503 的响应体（数据库停机中，用 HttpClient 读取）---

--- 场景3：媒体不在探测范围（MINIO_ENDPOINT 指向不可达主机）---
/health :: HTTP 200 :: {"code":0,"message":"ok","data":{"status":"degraded","dependencies":{"database":"unavailable","redis":"ok"}}}

--- 场景3（重做）：数据库恢复、媒体地址不可达时的探测表现 ---
/health :: HTTP 200 :: {"code":0,"message":"ok","data":{"status":"ok","dependencies":{"database":"ok","redis":"ok"}}}
/ready  :: HTTP 200 :: {"code":0,"message":"ok","data":{"status":"ok","dependencies":{"database":"ok","redis":"ok"}}}

--- 场景2 补充：数据库停机时 /ready 的完整响应体 ---
/health :: HTTP 200 :: {"code":0,"message":"ok","data":{"status":"degraded","dependencies":{"database":"unavailable","redis":"ok"}}}
/ready  :: HTTP 503 :: {"code":0,"message":"ok","data":{"status":"degraded","dependencies":{"database":"unavailable","redis":"ok"}}}

